Source: isakai
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Isakai contributors <https://github.com/yesheytenzin/isakai>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), zig (>= 0.17), default-jdk | openjdk-17-jdk, libxkbcommon-dev, libpulse-dev, libsqlite3-dev, libicu-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: isakai
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, default-jre | openjdk-17-jre, polkitd | policykit-1
Description: Run Android apps as native Linux processes
 Translates Android DEX to JVM bytecode at install time and runs the
 app on the host JVM with a reimplemented android.* framework on
 Wayland. No Android OS, no container, no runtime bundle download.
 Privileged app isolation goes through three pkexec polkit actions.
